{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:completion:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers multiple email addresses with completion handler."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmails:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"emails","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"completion:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"emails","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array of email address strings."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when the operation completes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Receives nil on success, or an NSError on failure."}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as ","type":"text"},{"code":"setEmails:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" but provides callback when the server registration completes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use this for confirmation UI or to chain dependent operations.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import emails from third-party login with confirmation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class SocialLoginHandler {","","    func handleGoogleSignIn(_ user: GIDGoogleUser) {","        var emails: [String] = []","","        \/\/ Primary email from Google","        if let email = user.profile?.email {","            emails.append(email)","        }","","        \/\/ Additional emails from Google profile if available","        if let additionalEmails = user.profile?.additionalEmails {","            emails.append(contentsOf: additionalEmails)","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmails(emails) { error in","            if let error = error {","                Analytics.track(\"email_sync_failed\", properties: [","                    \"provider\": \"google\",","                    \"email_count\": emails.count,","                    \"error\": error.localizedDescription","                ])","                return","            }","","            Analytics.track(\"email_sync_success\", properties: [","                \"provider\": \"google\",","                \"email_count\": emails.count","            ])","","            \/\/ Set user ID from Google","            Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(user.userID ?? \"\")","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:completion:"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmails:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"setEmails:completion:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmails:completion:","roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmails:completion:","kind":"identifier